<title>VENEZUELA: Venezuela banks and markets closed Monday, Tuesday.</title>
<headline>Venezuela banks and markets closed Monday, Tuesday.</headline>
<dateline>CARACAS 1997-02-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Venezuelan banks and financial markets are closed Monday Feb 10 and Tuesday Feb 11 for carnival. They will reopen on Wednesday Feb 12.</p>
<p>((-- Caracas newsroom, 582 505 2600))</p>
</text>
